    "modelAnswer": "The special item I saved up for was a high - quality wireless noise - cancelling headphone set about one and a half years ago. At that time, I often studied in noisy shared dormitory conditions. Constant background chatter and outside distractions made it really hard for me to focus on listening to online courses. My old cheap headphones had poor sound quality and could not block surrounding noise effectively. I realised a decent pair of noise - cancelling headphones would greatly improve my study efficiency. However, it was quite pricey and far beyond my regular monthly pocket money. Therefore, I made a clear saving plan. I cut down unnecessary spending on take - out food and fancy drinks, avoided impulse purchases of small decorative goods, and put aside a fixed sum of money from my monthly allowance every month. Occasionally I also took some simple part - time tasks in my spare time. After roughly four months of steady saving, I finally gathered enough money and placed the order. When I received the product, I felt a strong sense of achievement. It was not merely a piece of electronic gadget. It represented my self - control and patience. Up to now, I still use this pair of headphones almost every single day and I truly value this hard - earned purchase.",
    "modelAnswerZh": "我曾经攒钱购买的一件特别物品，是一年半之前的一副高品质无线降噪耳机。那时候，我经常在嘈杂的宿舍公共环境学习。持续的闲聊声和外界干扰，让我很难专心听网课。我旧的廉价耳机音质很差，也无法有效隔绝周遭噪音。我意识到一副不错的降噪耳机，可以大幅提升我的学习效率。但是它价格不菲，远远超出我每个月普通零花钱。于是我制定清晰存钱计划。我削减在外卖、花式饮料上的不必要开销，克制冲动购买小饰品，每个月从零花钱里存下固定一笔钱。空闲的时候我也会做一些简单兼职。经过大约四个月坚持存钱，我终于攒够钱下了订单。收到商品那一刻，我充满成就感。它不只是一个电子产品，更代表我的自律与耐心。直到现在，我几乎每天还在使用这副耳机，十分珍惜这份辛苦攒钱换来的物件。",
