    "modelAnswer": "The older person I admire is my maternal grandmother. I have known her my whole life; she is my grandma. When I was little, I spent a lot of my school holidays staying at her house. We enjoy doing many simple activities together. Sometimes we cook traditional home-style dishes in her kitchen. We also like sitting in the yard chatting. She often tells me stories about her youth and the changes she has witnessed over decades. I have huge respect for her. She went through many hard times in her life, yet she always stays kind and optimistic. Even in old age, she keeps learning new small skills, such as using simple functions on a smartphone. Her positive attitude towards life sets a really good example for me.",
